OL,3,A'Honeymoon at Gatwick': Passengers
OL,4,Adescribe airport chaos as No 10 backs
OL,5,Aair traffic control boss
OL,6,
OL,7,FImages show passengers sleeping on
OL,8,Fairport floors as more than 300 flights
OL,9,Fare cancelled after yesterday's
OL,10,Ftechnical problem at air traffic
OL,11,Fcontrol
OL,13,FSome 1,750 flights were cancelled on
OL,14,FTuesday, according to aviation
OL,15,Fanalytics firm Cirium, with hundreds of
OL,16,Fthousands of passengers affected by the
OL,17,Fchaos
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
