OL,3,A'Honeymoon at Gatwick': Passengers
OL,4,Adescribe airport chaos as No 10 backs
OL,5,Aair traffic control boss
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We're exhausted," one family tells us
OL,8,Fafter spending the night trying to
OL,9,Freach Manchester; another passenger
OL,10,Fdescribes "carnage" at Gatwick baggage
OL,11,Freclaim after his flight to Lanzarote
OL,12,Fwas cancelled
OL,14,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,15,Fhas apologised for the issue - the
OL,16,Ffirm's boss Martin Rolfe says there
OL,17,Fwill be an investigation
OL,19,FPM Andy Burnham's spokesman says the
OL,20,Fgovernment has confidence in Rolfe and
OL,21,Fthey're expecting to see a report into
OL,22,Fthe issue in a week's time
